  block multimembership_context: TextBlock {
    content: @md **Multi-membership.** The split below uses the bridge model, so a user whose first order contained two categories appears under **both** rows. Category totals therefore sum to more than the user base — that is the intended semantics, not double counting: `Cohort Size` is a distinct count and each user holds exactly one bridge row per category.;;
  }

