  block header_naive: TextBlock {
    content: @md # The trap: filtering after the cohort is formed

This tab uses **the same dataset, the same metrics and the same pivots** as the first. The only difference is where the two profile filters point: at `Products / Product Categories` on the order-line path, instead of at the acquisition bridge.

That is the thing worth being suspicious of in any cohort model — **a filter that trims output rows rather than cohort membership.** Leave the filters empty and this tab is identical to the first, which is exactly why the bug survives review. Set a category and watch LTV collapse.;;
  }

