  block naive_category_context: TextBlock {
    content: @md **The split, on the wrong path.** The mirror of this report on the first tab rows by `Category at Acquisition` — the bridge — so each row reads "users whose first order contained this category, and everything they spent since". This one rows by the line-item category instead, so each row reads "what this cohort spent *in that category*". The second is a legitimate question, but it is not cohort LTV, and nothing on the report says which one you are looking at.;;
  }

